WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.063
Why does factory work feel

2
00:00:02.063 --> 00:00:05.376
empty? Marx called it alienation.

3
00:00:05.743 --> 00:00:07.685
He set it out in

4
00:00:07.685 --> 00:00:10.615
the manuscripts of 1844.

5
00:00:10.615 --> 00:00:12.984
They were published only in

6
00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:14.398
the 1930s.

7
00:00:14.738 --> 00:00:16.625
Workers are alienated from what

8
00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:17.364
they make,

9
00:00:17.364 --> 00:00:19.208
and from the work itself.

10
00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:20.564
And from their own human

11
00:00:20.564 --> 00:00:22.715
nature, and from each other.

12
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.534
Use it to discuss gig

13
00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:27.498
work and informal labour today.

14
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.056
Your turn.

15
00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:31.390
Where did Marx discuss it?
